#. "L_AZT_009"
msgid "Locate and rescue President\n"
msgstr "大統領を発見し救助せよ\n"

#. "L_AZT_010"
msgid "There's the escape pod.\n"
msgstr "あれは脱出ポッドだわ！\n"

#. "L_AZT_011"
msgid "Maybe there's a beacon in there.\n"
msgstr "ＳＯＳ信号の発信装置が中にあるはずだわ。\n"

#. "L_AZT_012"
msgid "The jamming... It's coming from that ship.\n"
msgstr "妨害電波は…　あの船から出ているのね。\n"

#. "L_AZT_013"
msgid "Elvis... He'll be able to protect the President.\n"
msgstr "エルビス…　彼が大統領の面倒を見てくれるわね。\n"

#. "L_AZT_014"
msgid "Distress beacon has been activated.\n"
msgstr "ＳＯＳ信号の発信完了\n"

#. "L_AZT_015"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\n"
msgstr "任務遂行に不可欠な要素が破壊された\n"

#. "L_AZT_016"
msgid "Obtain Presidential Scanner.\n"
msgstr "Obtain Presidential Scanner.\n"

#. "L_AZT_017"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_AZT_018"
msgid "\n"
msgstr "\n"

#. "L_AZT_019"
msgid "A Presidential Scanner\n"
msgstr "大統領モニター\n"

#. "L_AZT_020"
msgid "Picked up a Presidential Scanner.\n"
msgstr "大統領モニターを手に入れた\n"

#. "L_AZT_021"
msgid "Jamming device has been shut down.\n"
msgstr "妨害電波の発信源が破壊された\n"

#. "L_AZT_022"
msgid "President has been killed.\n"
msgstr "大統領が倒された\n"

#. "L_AZT_023"
msgid "Presidential clone has been eliminated.\n"
msgstr "大統領のクローンが倒れた\n"

#. "L_AZT_024"
msgid "You'll never save him now!\n"
msgstr "アバヨ、大統領！\n"

#. "L_AZT_025"
msgid "President has been rescued.\n"
msgstr "大統領が救出された\n"

#. "L_AZT_026"
msgid "Obtain Night Vision.\n"
msgstr "Obtain Night Vision.\n"

#. "L_AZT_027"
msgid "Cassandra De Vries'\n"
msgstr "Cassandra De Vries'\n"

#. "L_AZT_028"
msgid "Night Vision\n"
msgstr "ナイトアイ\n"

#. "L_AZT_029"
msgid "Night Vision\n"
msgstr "ナイトアイ\n"

#. "L_AZT_030"
msgid "Picked up Night Vision.\n"
msgstr "ナイトアイを手に入れた\n"

#. "L_AZT_031"
msgid "Take this; you should find it useful!\n"
msgstr "これを持っていくといい、きっと役に立つよ！\n"

#. "L_AZT_032"
msgid "Ahhh... uuhhhh...\n"
msgstr "ウゥゥ…\n"

#. "L_AZT_033"
msgid "Ahhh... uhh... owww...\n"
msgstr "アァァ、ウゥゥ…\n"

#. "L_AZT_034"
msgid "Agent Dark! Please report!\n"
msgstr "エージェント・ダーク、応答せよ！\n"

#. "L_AZT_035"
msgid "Perfect Dark, come in!\n"
msgstr "聞こえるか、エージェント・ダーク！\n"

#. "L_AZT_036"
msgid "A-agent Dark reporting in...\n"
msgstr "こちらエージェント・ダーク…\n"

#. "L_AZT_037"
msgid "Agent Dark! Please reply!\n"
msgstr "エージェント・ダーク、応答せよ！\n"

#. "L_AZT_038"
msgid ""
"Something's jamming my transmissions... It's coming from that other craft.\n"
msgstr ""
"通信が妨害されているみたい…\n"
"近くに何かあるのかしら。\n"

#. "L_AZT_039"
msgid ""
"I'd better find the jamming device and check that Elvis is okay. Not "
"forgetting the President, of course.\n"
msgstr ""
"エルビスは無事かしら…\n"
"そうそう、大統領を探さなきゃ。\n"

#. "L_AZT_040"
msgid "How are you feeling, Mr. President?\n"
msgstr "調子はどう？　大統領。\n"

#. "L_AZT_041"
msgid ""
"Better now, young lady. Today, I think, will take a while for me to get "
"over. I can't believe Easton would do such a thing. I knew he was ambitious,"
" yes, but this...\n"
msgstr ""
"かなりマシになったよ。\n"
"しかしトレントめ…\n"
"pヤツが野心家であることは\n"
"前から気づいていたが、ここまでとは…\n"

#. "L_AZT_042"
msgid ""
"Just one thing, sir? What is the Pelagic II that Trent wanted so badly?\n"
msgstr ""
"トレントたちが必死になっている\n"
"「ペラジック２」とは何なの？\n"

#. "L_AZT_043"
msgid ""
"It's a U.S. government deep sea research vessel, one of a kind... The only "
"ship that can conduct a full-scale diving operation at extreme depth. Trent "
"wanted me to loan it to the dataDyne Corporation, but I refused.\n"
msgstr ""
"政府の深海探査艇だ。\n"
"p最深海で潜水作業が行える\n"
"世界唯一の船だ。\n"
"pいったいヤツらは何が目的なんだ？\n"

#. "L_AZT_044"
msgid "Trent has a lot to answer for, but I don't think we'll find him now.\n"
msgstr ""
"トレントを、問いつめなきゃ。\n"
"でも、どこにいるのかしら…\n"

#. "L_AZT_045"
msgid ""
"You have failed, Easton. You are a flawed device, and we need you no "
"longer.\n"
msgstr ""
"トレント、またしくじったな！\n"
"お前のようなヤツに、もはや用は無い。\n"

#. "L_AZT_046"
msgid "Just try it, you Scandinavian freak!\n"
msgstr "やってみやがれ、この金髪ヤロー！\n"

#. "L_AZT_047"
msgid "Noooooooo!!!\n"
msgstr "ＮＯ！！！！\n"
